class NightMarker:
    """What bounds one night: curfew or release at the start, wake-up at the end.

    Deliberately not an Event: event kinds are mandatory by default, so a
    curfew scheduled as an obligation would block the sleep it bounds.
    ``wake=None`` means the night has no wake-up call (Saturday, before the
    Sunday off day) and its end comes from the assumption set instead.

    A night has a curfew or, when the itinerary gives none, ``released_by``:
    the id of the obligation whose end releases players (the game, the bus back
    to the facility). Never both, so the report can say which one set the start.
    """

